gating on voiceProfile alone — same one-capability shape as icp-lock's
own "ICP Targeting Locked", for the same reason (the gate only
requires the one field). worker-capability-status.ts gets
filledKeysForVoiceCapture, reading straight from getColdOpenConfig
(the same real source checkVoiceCapture itself reads). Both files'
header comments corrected — they claimed "only the Phase 2 top-5" /
"scoped to the same 5 Phase 2 workers," no longer true as of this
commit.

Wired the existing, already-generic WorkerCapabilityMatrix into
voice-capture-config-form.tsx — read-only, additive, existing
load/save logic completely untouched.

